#. module: l10n_sk_invoice
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_sk_invoice.field_account_move__l10n_sk_legal_notes
msgid ""
"Mandatory §74 phrases printed on the invoice — auto-detected from the taxes "
"and the customer's country, plus the manual note."
msgstr ""
"Povinné formulace podle § 74 tištěné na faktuře — automaticky zjištěné z "
"daní a země zákazníka, plus ruční poznámka."

